<title> Polyarticular Arthritis: Diagnosis. </title>
<graphic href="eee0705-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>Polyarticular arthritis. Complete history and physical. Specific clinical diagnosis suspected?</label>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-2">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Synovitis present? Can aspirate joint if unsure.</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-5">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-4">
<label>Acute versus chronic?</label>
<path target="cell-7">Acute</path>
<path target="cell-6">Chronic</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-6">
<label>Lumbosacral involvement?</label>
<path target="cell-9">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>Consider rheumatoid arthritis, systemic lupus erythematosus or other rheumatologic etiologies (see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-9">
<label>Consider ankylosing spondylitis, psoriatic arthritis, inflammatory bowel disease spondyloarthropathy (see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-7">
<label>Consider viral arthritis, postviral syndrome, early rheumatic disease (see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-5">
<label>Consider osteoarthritis, fibromyalgia, polymyalgia rheumatica (see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Consider appropriate confirmatory tests (see <xref ref="table001" />).</label>
</cell>
</algorithm>
